<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="5">
<Content>
<Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
<Text>INT. THERMOPYLAE EXCAVATION SITE - DAY</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Action">
<Text>Dust hangs in the air. DR. NINA ORTIZ kneels over a fragment of bronze armor.</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Character">
<Text>NINA ORTIZ</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
<Text>This isn't Macedonian. This is older.</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Character">
<Text>FIELD CREW LEAD</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
<Text>Doctor, you need to see this.</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
<Text>EXT. BATTLEFIELD TRENCH - DUSK</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Action">
<Text>The ground SHIMMERS. Nina's vision blurs as the modern world dissolves.</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Character">
<Text>NINA ORTIZ</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
<Text>No. Not again.</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
<Text>EXT. HOT GATES PASS - DAY</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Action">
<Text>Three hundred SPARTAN SOLDIERS hold the narrow pass. LEONIDAS stands at their center.</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Character">
<Text>LEONIDAS</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
<Text>You are not of this world, woman. Speak quickly.</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Character">
<Text>NINA ORTIZ</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
<Text>I know what happens here. I know how this ends.</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
<Text>INT. COMMAND TENT - NIGHT</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Action">
<Text>A single oil lamp illuminates a crude map of the pass.</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Character">
<Text>LEONIDAS</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
<Text>If what you say is true, then every man here dies regardless.</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Character">
<Text>NINA ORTIZ</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
<Text>Not regardless. Because of what you choose tonight.</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
<Text>EXT. EXCAVATION SITE - DAWN</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Action">
<Text>Nina gasps awake in the present, the bronze fragment still in her hand.</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Character">
<Text>FIELD CREW LEAD</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
<Text>Doctor? You were gone for a second there.</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Character">
<Text>NINA ORTIZ</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
<Text>I wasn't gone. I was there.</Text>
</Paragraph>
</Content>
</FinalDraft>
